"documentation/use/guide-overview.cy.js/overview-full.png)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/knowledge-base.md:22
msgid ""
"Click **Knowledge Base** in the primary navigation to open it. The knowledge "
"base opens in preview mode, which looks similar to the published version "
"customers see."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/knowledge-base.md:26
msgid ""
"The knowledge base is organized into **categories** that can contain "
"subcategories and **answers** (articles).  Each category requires an icon "
"and a title. Answers consist of a title and rich text content with "
"formatting, images, videos, file attachments, and links."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/documentation/use/guides/knowledge-base.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr ""

