#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Host upgrade steps"
msgstr "Host-Upgrade-Schritte"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable updates for Zammad"
msgstr "Aktualisierungen für Zammad deaktivieren"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper addlock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf upgrade --exclude zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark hold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper addlock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf upgrade --exclude zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform host upgrade"
msgstr "Host-Upgrade durchführen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:74
msgid ""
"Perform the host upgrade according to the documentation of your operating "
"system. Because this is an advanced task, we don't provide detailed steps "
"here. After upgrading your operating system, proceed with the next steps."
msgstr ""
"Führen Sie das Host-Upgrade gemäß der Dokumentation Ihres Betriebssystems "
"durch. Da es sich hierbei um eine anspruchsvolle und umfangreiche Aufgabe "
"handelt, gibt es dazu hier keine Anleitung. Nach dem Upgrade Ihres "
"Betriebssystems fahren Sie mit den nächsten Schritten fort."

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reboot host"
msgstr "Host neu starten"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:80
msgid ""
"In case you did not reboot your system after the upgrade, make sure to "
"reboot your system now. Afterwards, check if everything is running as "
"expected. In case Zammad starts automatically, stop it again before "
"proceeding with the next steps."
msgstr ""
"Falls Sie Ihr System nach dem Upgrade nicht neu gestartet haben, müssen Sie "
"es jetzt neu starten. Prüfen Sie anschließend, ob alles wie erwartet läuft. "
"Falls Zammad automatisch startet, stoppen Sie es wieder, bevor Sie mit den "
"nächsten Schritten fortfahren."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust package repository"
msgstr "Paketquelle anpassen"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:83
