#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:303
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update Zammad"
msgstr "Zammad aktualisieren"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:305
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If there is a new Zammad version available and you want to update to it, check the\n"
"[release notes](https://zammad.com/en/product/releases){target=_blank} for any required additional steps.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn eine neue Version von Zammad verfügbar ist und Sie auf diese aktualisieren möchten, lesen Sie die\n"
"[Release Notes](https://zammad.com/de/product/releases){target=_blank} für erforderliche zusätzliche Schritte.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:311
msgid ""
"Re-enable updates for Zammad and update Zammad to the latest version "
"available for your operating system."
msgstr ""
"Aktivieren Sie die Updates für Zammad wieder und aktualisieren Sie Zammad "
"auf die neueste Version, die für Ihr Betriebssystem verfügbar ist."

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:distros)
#: src/en/get-started/host-upgrade-repo-migration.md:312
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"Update package index:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Re-enable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark unhold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Debian\n"
"\n"
"Update package index:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Re-enable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark unhold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt upgrade zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== OpenSUSE/SLES\n"
"\n"
"Update package index:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper refresh\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Re-enable updates for Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper removelock zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo zypper update zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS/RHEL\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo dnf upgrade zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu\n"
"\n"
"Aktualisierung des Paketindexes:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt update\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Aktivieren der Aktualisierung für Zammad:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"sudo apt-mark unhold zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
