#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:313
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage services of Zammad"
msgstr "Zammad Services verwalten"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:316
msgid ""
"Zammad uses three services. These services can be managed individually or "
"all at once by using the parent **zammad**."
msgstr ""
"Zammad verwendet drei Dienste. Diese Dienste können einzeln oder alle auf "
"einmal verwaltet werden, indem der übergeordnete Dienst **zammad** verwendet "
"wird."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:321
msgid "zammad: includes the services below"
msgstr "zammad: umfasst die folgenden Dienste"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:321
msgid ""
"**zammad-web**: internal puma server (relevant for displaying the web app)"
msgstr ""
"**zammad-web**: interner Puma-Server (relevant für die Anzeige der "
"Webanwendung)"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:321
msgid ""
"**zammad-worker**: background worker - relevant for all delayed- and "
"background jobs"
msgstr ""
"**zammad-worker**: Hintergrund-Worker - relevant für alle verzögerten "
"Aufgaben sowie Hintergrundaufgaben"

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:321
msgid "**zammad-websocket**: WebSocket server for session related information"
msgstr ""
"**zammad-websocket**: WebSocket-Server für sitzungsbezogene Informationen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/package.md:323
msgid ""
"Manage the services with `systemctl`'s commands `start`, `restart`, `stop`, "
"`status`."
msgstr ""
"Verwalten Sie die Dienste mit den `systemctl`-Befehlen `start`, `restart`, "
"`stop`, `status`."

