#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:200
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update Docker installation"
msgstr "Docker-Installation aktualisieren"

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:202
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Docker Compose stack updates may require extra steps or introduce breaking\n"
"changes. Always check the [Docker Compose release notes](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose/releases){target=_blank}\n"
"for update instructions first.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aktualisierungen des Docker Compose Stacks können zusätzliche Schritte erfordern\n"
"oder Breaking Changes beinhalten. Prüfen Sie immer zuerst die [Docker Compose Release-Notes](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose/releases){target=_blank}\n"
"auf Hinweise für die Aktualisierungen.\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tip)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:208
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you want to update Zammad to a specific version, use the `VERSION` environment variable\n"
"([example](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose/blob/master/.env.dist){target=_blank}\n"
"with further explanation) and specify the version number.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie Zammad auf eine bestimmte Version aktualisieren möchten, verwenden Sie die Umgebungsvariable\n"
"`VERSION` ([Beispiel](https://github.com/zammad/zammad-docker-compose/blob/master/.env.dist){target=_blank} mit weiteren Details)\n"
"und geben die gewünscht Version an.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:214
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updating Portainer based installations"
msgstr "Portainer-basierte Installation aktualisieren"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:218
msgid ""
"In your Zammad stack, click on `Pull and redeploy`, activate **Re-pull image "
"and redeploy** and click on `Update`."
msgstr ""
"Klicken Sie in Ihrem Zammad-Stack auf `Pull and redeploy`, aktivieren Sie "
"**Re-pull image and redeploy** und klicken Sie auf `Update`."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:220
msgid ""
"![Highlighted stack update in Portainer](/screenshots/get-started/"
"installation/portainer-stack-update.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Hervorhebung der Stack-Aktualisierung in Portainer](/screenshots/get-"
"started/installation/portainer-stack-update.png)"

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:221
#, no-wrap
msgid "Updating Docker Compose based installations"
msgstr "Docker Compose-basierte Installation aktualisieren"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:227
#, no-wrap
msgid "git pull\n"
msgstr "git pull\n"

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:231
#, no-wrap
msgid "docker compose pull\n"
msgstr "docker compose pull\n"

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs key:docker-portainer)
#: src/en/get-started/update.md:243
#: src/en/tutorials/backup-restore-docker.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Docker Compose\n"
"\n"
"Without specifying CPU cores:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rake zammad:searchindex:rebuild\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"With specifying CPU cores to use (example 8):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rake zammad:searchindex:rebuild[8]\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Portainer\n"
"\n"
"Open the [console via Portainer's GUI](/en/get-started/installation/docker#how-to-run-commands-in-the-stack) with the\n"
"standard entrypoint `/bin/bash` and run:\n"
"\n"
"Without specifying CPU cores to use:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"bundle exec rake zammad:searchindex:rebuild\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"With specifying CPU cores to use (example 8):\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"bundle exec rake zammad:searchindex:rebuild[8]\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"=== Docker Compose\n"
"\n"
"Ohne Angabe von CPU-Kernen:\n"
"\n"
"``````sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rake zammad:searchindex:rebuild\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Mit Angabe der zu verwendenden CPU-Kerne (Beispiel: 8):\n"
"\n"
"``````sh\n"
"docker compose run --rm zammad-railsserver bundle exec rake zammad:searchindex:rebuild[8]\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== Portainer\n"
"\n"
"Öffnen Sie die [Konsole über die Portainer-Benutzeroberfläche](/de/get-started/installation/docker#ausfuhren-von-befehlen-im-stack) mit dem\n"
"Standard-Entrypoint `/bin/bash` und führen Sie Folgendes aus:\n"
"\n"
"Ohne Angabe der zu verwendenden CPU-Kerne:\n"
"\n"
"``````sh\n"
"bundle exec rake zammad:searchindex:rebuild\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Mit Angabe der zu verwendenden CPU-Kerne (Beispiel: 8):\n"
"\n"
"``````sh\n"
"bundle exec rake zammad:searchindex:rebuild[8]\n"
"```\n"
"\n"

