#~ msgid ""
#~ "After entering a search term, you immediately see a preview of the search "
#~ "results. These results are separated by type to make sure you won't get "
#~ "lost in the results. Selecting one of those results will open a new "
#~ "navigation tab (if not already opened) with the item."
